    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interstellar Sentinel 2 is an action-packed shoot'em up that takes you on a cyberpunk sci-fi journey to PAL Tech world, an Ecumenopolis where the cosmic balance of power is being consumed by Gressle, a cybernitc Weretech line of mercenaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An inspired love letter to some of the best side-scrolling games ever made</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I grew up playing games like Salamander/Life Force, Gradius, R-Type, Super Aleste, Einhander, Ikaruga, and more. Interstellar Sentinel features tight controls, digital &amp; analog stick (PlayStation &amp; Xbox controllers verified), stylized beautiful art with light anime inspiration, and a rewarding experience that becomes more challenging as your skills grow.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interstellar Sentinel 2 is an action-packed shoot'em up that takes you on a cyberpunk sci-fi journey to PAL Tech world, an Ecumenopolis where the cosmic balance of power is being consumed by Gressle, a cybernitc Weretech line of mercenaries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An inspired love letter to some of the best side-scrolling games ever made</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I grew up playing games like Salamander/Life Force, Gradius, R-Type, Super Aleste, Einhander, Ikaruga, and more. Interstellar Sentinel features tight controls, digital &amp; analog stick (PlayStation &amp; Xbox controllers verified), stylized beautiful art with light anime inspiration, and a rewarding experience that becomes more challenging as your skills grow.</p>",
    "short_description": "A thrilling sci-fi cyberpunk shmup / shoot'em up with epic boss battles and a vast arsenal of futuristic weapons! Battle through the Ecumenopolis, restore the cosmic balance, and save the universe! Flow state gaming to unleash your inner hero! Feel your skills grow on your way to 1CC S+ tier rank!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
